{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"1982年12月11日，中国象棋的全国比赛进行到第十轮，杨官璘迎战柳大华。两位大师功力悉敌，自始至终紧扣观众的心弦。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7a7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b6c6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a7a8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2i2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a8c8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6d6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7b5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"双方以中炮过河车对屏风马平炮兑车的流行布局拉开战幕。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2e1","comment":"这手棋，在60年代的常见走法有炮五进四或炮一进四取卒，及车六进二捉炮等，至70年代又出现车二进六的变化。现在退马归心，是今年来涌现出来的新变例，在地方性的比赛中有个别棋手探索使用过。柳大华在全国棋赛中勇于实践，率先应用，既丰富了此类变着的内容，也充分反映出棋手们在80年代积极开创新局面的风貌和才华。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c5c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d6d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c8c3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b5d4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9b7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7d7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2f4","comment":"柳大华右车过河，中炮左移，进马盘河，一连串的战术组合衔接得相当紧凑，显得对新阵法颇有研究。棋谚有云，“马归宫，必定凶”。柳的归心马却有预控杨马进路之妙。经验丰富的杨官璘如何透视局势？观战者莫不怀着极大的兴趣凝神以待。第12回合时，杨如果改走卒3进1去兵，柳车二进六以后再马三进四，主动权亦操在柳方手中。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6g6","comment":"杨平炮邀柳兑车，柳则扫卒压马，准备改兑左车得子，将攻势更紧一步。杨方阵地一时战云密布，大有“山雨欲来风满楼”之感！","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9h2","comment":"杨官璘不愧是驰骋弈林三十余载的特级大师，经过苦心推敲，终于弈出了这一停车问路的上佳棋步！这手棋以攻代守，围魏救赵，而又锋芒内敛。经局后研究，当时柳方如果贪图得子而走车六进二，柳方后防将会全面崩溃。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3b3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b3b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d4f5","comment":"柳大华沉思有顷，凭直觉判断杨官璘进车后颇有反击手段，权衡利弊，劫取一子实不及中兵渡河助战。他所见极是，但第19回合兵平四路却有欠细心，此刻宜平二线阻断杨车归路，则攻守两利。第20回合，杨马去兵机警可法。\r\n双方明争暗斗，激烈交锋。对弈至此，表面上似乎风平浪静，实际上潜流暗礁比比皆是，一场微妙深邃的中局争斗正在酝酿形成。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9a7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a7c5","comment":"杨官璘回车邀兑，稳固阵形。柳大华平车攻象，将杨象调离底线，如此交换，显出功夫老练。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6h3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b3b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i2i1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i1g1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8g8","comment":"柳大华第25回合弃中兵以畅车路，不无胆识。如果车二进四盯马，杨方可走炮2退4或炮9进4，柳方均无便宜。第28回合柳平炮欠妥，宜选择车二进四，保持平炮攻马和边炮取卒两种攻势，则较易发展。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d7f7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2b2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c5a7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h3c3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f7b7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7f7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2b2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f7b7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2a2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7f7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a2a6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5h4","comment":"杨官璘素以善弈平淡局势著称，每多奇峭突兀之着。第29回合，杨亦可炮5平4闪开中卒进路，现在移车左方士角，置于马后“叶底藏花”，是其含蓄之处。至第35回合单骑跨河闯关，始露出志决雌雄的真意。年近花甲而进取精神不减当年，足见老骥伏枥之心。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a6b6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g1f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b6b3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f3g1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e0f0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3e3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b3b1","comment":"铁骑突出刀枪鸣，重炮守城霹雳飞。小柳第36回合机警地平炮佯攻，接着主动退炮将杨马“请”进卧槽，企图套擒杨马。一个要进，一个愿“请”，两相情愿，各有机谋，着实耐人寻味。此马是死是活？命运攸关，双方势将全力以争。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f7f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3g3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g8f8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f1f2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g1i0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3h3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f8f9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b1b5","comment":"第44回合，杨方眼见己马已陷绝境，他却不慌不忙地退炮等待；第45回合，柳又居然不捉死马，原来其中各有奥妙。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0g1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h3h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a7c5","comment":"棋战进行至此，双方均已进入每半小时至少走20步的用时紧张阶段。大敌当前，前几个回合都为判断是否死马用去较多的思考时间。以致第46回合时均无暇细思，疏漏在所难免。局后分析发现，柳车轻离要津改攻河口敌马，实属冒险，不如炮八退四重驱卧槽马稳妥。杨方急于救马随手飞象隔炮，不料错失良机于一瞬之间，深为可惜。如改走炮5进1作杀，先弃后取，即能占取上风。几种变化的结果都是杨方优势。怎奈棋路纷纭，变化多端，用时又受限制，当局者实难算无遗漏，舍繁就简，亦是正常途径。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b5e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a3a4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4b3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f2f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b3b2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0d0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a4a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d0g0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f1e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f3f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f9f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4g2","comment":"这几步棋，杨官璘用炮有如穿花蛱蝶，步姿轻盈，迫柳大华于过河兵投入战斗之前相互兑子，由此简化局势。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6b6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5f9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5h1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b6e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e5d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e8f7","comment":"柳平帅还杀，迫杨退炮回防，然后运车再度胁马，弈来次序井然。这是有关胜负的最后战机，杨先平车捉炮，再扬士照将，从容应对，具见成竹在胸。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f1e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6b6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a5b5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b6a6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b5a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"ne